        "product_summary": "Mesh and overlay upper: Large mesh windows sit between synthetic leather panels around the front and quarter of this lace-up casual shoe.\n\nLayered toe outline: A broad overlay wraps around the front and side of the rounded forefoot, creating a clearly defined toe profile.\n\nLace adjustment: The eyelet row runs along the centre opening above the tongue, allowing the lacing to be adjusted over the instep.\n\nSegmented sole edge: Polygon-shaped sections along the dark sidewall form the distinctive outsole profile; a forefoot underside close-up shows the bottom texture.\n\nTwo colour directions: Black and Green are listed in EU39-44, each with matching panel and mesh geometry.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
